3. Fase principal y control: Haz una pausa por un momento en la parte superior, luego baja lentamente la banda de vuelta a la posición inicial.

4. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and hold the band in front of your thighs with your palms facing down.

2. Initial Execution: Keep your arms straight and lift the band up in front of you until your arms are parallel to the ground.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the band back down to the starting position.

4. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Fique em pé com os pés afastados na largura dos ombros e segure a faixa elástica frente aos coxas com as palmas para baixo.

