6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia de lado.', '1. Starting Setup: Attach the band to a sturdy anchor point above your head.

2. Initial Execution: Kneel down and hold the band with one hand, palm facing down.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Extend your arm fully overhead, keeping your elbow slightly bent.

