3. Fase principal y control: Haz una pausa por un momento en la parte superior, luego baja lentamente el antebrazo de vuelta a la posición inicial.

4. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Lie on your side with your legs extended and your head supported by your arm.

2. Initial Execution: Hold your upper arm against your side and bend your elbow to curl your forearm towards your shoulder.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your forearm back down to the starting position.

