3. Fase principal y control: Tira de la toalla hacia el pecho, juntando los omóplatos.

4. Retorno controlado: Haz una pausa breve en la parte más alta, luego baja lentamente la toalla de vuelta a la posición inicial.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia al otro brazo.', '1. Starting Setup: Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, knees slightly bent, and hold a towel with one hand.

2. Initial Execution: Bend forward at the hips, keeping your back straight and your core engaged.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Pull the towel towards your chest, squeezing your shoulder blades together.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the towel back to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch to the other arm.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Fique em pé com os pés afastados na largura dos ombros, os joelhos ligeiramente flexionadas, e segure uma toalha com uma mão.

