6. Paso 6: Flexiona los codos y baja la barra detrás de la cabeza, manteniendo la parte superior de los brazos cerca de las orejas.

7. Paso 7: Haz una pausa por un momento y luego extiende los brazos de vuelta a la posición inicial.

8. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Adjust the cable machine to a low pulley position.

2. Initial Execution: Attach a straight bar to the cable.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Stand facing away from the machine with your feet shoulder-width apart.

4. Controlled Return: Grasp the bar with an overhand grip and extend your arms straight overhead.

5. Step 5: Lean forward slightly, keeping your back straight and core engaged.

6. Step 6: Bend your elbows and lower the bar behind your head, keeping your upper arms close to your ears.

7. Step 7: Pause for a moment, then extend your arms back to the starting position.

