6. Paso 6: Suelta lentamente la agarradera de vuelta a la posición inicial.

7. Paso 7: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.

8. Paso 8: Cambia de lado y repite el ejercicio con el otro brazo.', '1. Starting Setup: Attach a handle to a cable machine at waist height.

2. Initial Execution: Kneel down facing the cable machine and grab the handle with one hand.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Keep your back straight and your core engaged.

4. Controlled Return: Pull the handle towards your chest, squeezing your shoulder blades together.

