3. Fase principal y control: Curva lentamente el cable hacia la frente, manteniendo la parte superior de los brazos inmóvil.

4. Retorno controlado: Haz una pausa breve en la parte más baja del movimiento, luego vuelve lentamente a la posición inicial.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on an exercise ball and hold the cable handle with an underhand grip.

2. Initial Execution: Extend your arms fully overhead, keeping your elbows close to your ears.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Slowly curl the cable down towards your forehead, keeping your upper arms stationary.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the bottom of the movement, then slowly return to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se sobre um bola de exercício e segure a puxador do cabo com uma pegada supinada.

