5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a bench facing the cable machine with your feet flat on the ground.

2. Initial Execution: Grasp the cable handles with an overhand grip and extend your arms straight in front of you.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Keeping your arms straight, slowly raise them out to the sides until they are parallel to the floor.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your arms back to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se num banco frente à máquina de cabo com os pés apoiados apoiados no chão.

