5. Paso 5: Repite del otro lado.

6. Paso 6: Alterna los lados durante el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and grasp the cable handle with one hand.

2. Initial Execution: Keep your back straight and your core engaged.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Slowly bend sideways at the waist, lowering the cable handle towards your knee.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment, then return to the starting position.

