5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia de lado.', '1. Starting Setup: Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart, holding a cable handle in one hand.

2. Initial Execution: Place the other hand on your hip.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Engage your core and slowly bend sideways towards the hand holding the cable, keeping your back straight.

