6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Stand facing a cable machine with your feet shoulder-width apart.

2. Initial Execution: Hold the cable handle with an overhand grip, palms facing down.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Keep your arms straight and your elbows close to your sides.

