4. Retorno controlado: Activa los dorsales y tira de la barra hacia abajo, hacia los muslos, manteniendo los brazos rectos durante todo el movimiento.

5. Paso 5: Haz una pausa por un momento en la parte baja y luego regresa lentamente la barra a la posición inicial.

6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Attach a straight bar to the high pulley of a cable machine.

2. Initial Execution: Stand facing the machine with your feet shoulder-width apart.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Grasp the bar with an overhand grip, keeping your arms straight and your palms facing down.

4. Controlled Return: Engage your lats and pull the bar down towards your thighs, keeping your arms straight throughout the movement.

5. Step 5: Pause for a moment at the bottom, then slowly return the bar to the starting position.

6. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Coloque uma barra reta na polia alta de uma máquina de cabo.

