3. Fase principal y control: Baja las mancuernas a los lados del pecho, manteniendo los codos ligeramente flexionados.

4. Retorno controlado: Empuja las mancuernas de nuevo hacia arriba hasta la posición inicial, extendiendo completamente los brazos.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Lie on a decline bench with your feet secured and your head lower than your hips.

2. Initial Execution: Hold a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing each other and your arms extended above your chest.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Lower the dumbbells to the sides of your chest, keeping your elbows slightly bent.

4. Controlled Return: Press the dumbbells back up to the starting position, fully extending your arms.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Deite-se num banco declinado com os pés presos e a cabeça mais desça que as quadris.

