4. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Stand up straight with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.

2. Initial Execution: Keep your upper arms stationary and curl the dumbbells as high as possible while contracting your biceps.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position.

