4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbell back to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch to the other arm.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se num banco inclinado com um halter numa mão, apoiada sobre o coxa.

