3. Primary Phase & Control: Keeping your upper arm stationary, slowly lower the dumbbell behind your head by bending your elbow.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the bottom, then extend your arm back up to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch arms.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Deite-se de barriga para cima num banco com as costas e a cabeça apoiadas, e os pés apoiados sobre o chão.

