2. Initial Execution: Hold a dumbbell with both hands and extend your arms straight up over your chest.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Slowly lower the dumbbell behind your head while keeping your arms straight.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment, then raise the dumbbell back to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se sobre um bola suíça (fitball) e roda para a frente até que a parte superior das costas fique apoiada no bola.

