5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Lie face down on a flat bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inwards.

2. Initial Execution: Extend your arms straight down towards the floor, keeping a slight bend in your elbows.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Engaging your back muscles, lift the dumbbells up towards your chest, squeezing your shoulder blades together.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbells back down to the starting position.

