2. Initial Execution: Hold a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing up and your arms fully extended.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Keeping your upper arms stationary, curl the dumbbells towards your shoulders by contracting your forearms.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position.

