4. Retorno controlado: Haz una pausa breve y luego extiende los brazos de vuelta a la posición inicial.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Lie flat on a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing each other.

2. Initial Execution: Extend your arms straight up over your chest, keeping your elbows close to your body.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Lower the dumbbells down towards your forehead, bending your elbows.

