6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia de brazo.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a preacher bench with a dumbbell in one hand and your upper arm resting on the pad.

2. Initial Execution: Hold the dumbbell with a neutral grip (palms facing your body).

3. Primary Phase & Control: Keeping your upper arm stationary, exhale and curl the dumbbell up towards your shoulder.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, squeezing your biceps.

5. Step 5: Inhale and slowly lower the dumbbell back to the starting position.

6. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch arms.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se num banco Scott com um halter numa mão e o braço superior apoiado sobre a apoio acolchoado.

2. Execução inicial: Segure o halter com pegada neutra (palmas em direção ao corpo).

