5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia de brazo.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on an exercise ball with your feet flat on the ground and your knees bent at a 90-degree angle.

2. Initial Execution: Hold a dumbbell with one hand and extend your arm straight up above your chest.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Slowly lower the dumbbell behind your head while keeping your arm straight.

