5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia de brazo.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a preacher bench with your chest against the pad and your arm extended over the edge of the bench, holding a dumbbell with an underhand grip.

2. Initial Execution: Lower the dumbbell slowly until your arm is fully extended.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Curl the dumbbell back up towards your shoulder, keeping your upper arm stationary.

4. Controlled Return: Squeeze your biceps at the top of the movement, then slowly lower the dumbbell back down to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch arms.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se num banco Scott com o peito contra a apoio acolchoado e o braço estendido sobre o borda do banco, segurando um halter com pegada supinada.

