5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia al otro brazo.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a bench with your feet flat on the ground and hold a dumbbell in one hand, palm facing down.

2. Initial Execution: Rest your forearm on the bench with your wrist hanging off the edge.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Slowly curl your wrist upwards, bringing the dumbbell towards your forearm.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbell back down to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch to the other arm.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se num banco com os pés apoiados no chão e segure um halter com uma mão, com a palma para baixo.

