5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a bench with your feet flat on the ground and hold a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing down.

2. Initial Execution: Rest your forearms on the bench, allowing your wrists to hang off the edge.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Slowly curl your wrists upward, bringing the dumbbells towards your body.

