5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia de brazo.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a preacher curl bench with your feet flat on the floor.

2. Initial Execution: Hold a dumbbell in one hand with an underhand grip, resting your upper arm against the preacher pad.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Keeping your upper arm stationary, exhale and curl the dumbbell up towards your shoulder.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then inhale and slowly lower the dumbbell back down to the starting position.

