5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia al otro brazo.', '1. Starting Setup: Stand up straight with your feet shoulder-width apart and hold a dumbbell in one hand with an overhand grip.

2. Initial Execution: Keep your arm fully extended and close to your body, with your palm facing down.

