6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia de lado.', '1. Starting Setup: Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and hold a dumbbell in your right hand.

2. Initial Execution: Bend your knees slightly and hinge forward at the hips, keeping your back straight.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Bring your right elbow up to your side, keeping it bent at a 90-degree angle.

