3. Fase principal y control: Sube la barra curvando el brazo hacia el hombro mientras mantienes el brazo superior inmóvil.

4. Retorno controlado: Contrae los bíceps en la parte superior del movimiento, luego baja lentamente la barra a la posición inicial.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a bench with your feet flat on the ground and hold an EZ barbell with an underhand grip.

2. Initial Execution: Rest your elbow on the inside of your thigh, just above the knee.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Curl the barbell up towards your shoulder while keeping your upper arm stationary.

4. Controlled Return: Squeeze your biceps at the top of the movement, then slowly lower the barbell back down to the starting position.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se num banco com os pés apoiados no chão e segure uma barra W (EZ) com pegada supinada.

2. Execução inicial: Apoie o cotovelo na parte interna do coxa, exatamente acima do joelho.

