4. Retorno controlado: Baja la barra lentamente hacia la frente, doblando los codos.

5. Paso 5: Haz una pausa por un momento y luego extiende los brazos de vuelta a la posición inicial.

6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Lie on a decline bench with your head lower than your feet and your feet secured.

2. Initial Execution: Hold the ez barbell with an overhand grip, hands shoulder-width apart.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Extend your arms fully, keeping your elbows close to your head.

4. Controlled Return: Lower the barbell slowly towards your forehead, bending your elbows.

5. Step 5: Pause for a moment, then extend your arms back to the starting position.

6. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Deite-se num banco declinado com a cabeça mais desça que os pés e os pés presos.

