3. Fase principal y control: Extiende completamente los brazos por encima de la cabeza, manteniendo los codos cerca de la cabeza.

4. Retorno controlado: Baja la barra detrás de la cabeza doblando los codos, manteniendo los brazos superiores inmóviles.

5. Paso 5: Haz una pausa por un momento y luego extiende los brazos de vuelta a la posición inicial.

6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Set up an incline bench at a 45-degree angle.

2. Initial Execution: Sit on the bench with your back against the pad and hold the ez barbell with an overhand grip.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Extend your arms fully overhead, keeping your elbows close to your head.

4. Controlled Return: Lower the barbell behind your head by bending your elbows, keeping your upper arms stationary.

5. Step 5: Pause for a moment, then extend your arms back to the starting position.

6. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Coloque um banco inclinado a um ângulo de 45 graus.

2. Execução inicial: Sente-se no banco com as costas apoiada no encosto e segure a barra W (EZ) com pegada pronada.

