4. Retorno controlado: Empuja la barra de vuelta a la posición inicial, extendiendo completamente los brazos.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Lie flat on a bench with your feet flat on the ground and your back pressed against the bench.

2. Initial Execution: Grasp the ez barbell with an overhand grip, slightly wider than shoulder-width apart.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Lower the barbell to your chest, keeping your elbows tucked in close to your body.

4. Controlled Return: Push the barbell back up to the starting position, fully extending your arms.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Deite-se sobre um banco com os pés apoiados no chão e as costas pressionada contra o banco.

