6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a preacher bench with your chest against the pad and your feet flat on the floor.

2. Initial Execution: Grasp the ez barbell with an underhand grip, hands shoulder-width apart.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Rest your upper arms on the pad, allowing your forearms to hang down.

