5. Step 5: Pause for a moment at the top, squeezing your biceps.

6. Step 6: Inhale and slowly lower the ez barbell back to the starting position.

7. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Sente-se num banco com os pés apoiados apoiados no chão e as costas retas.

