4. Retorno controlado: Baja las pesas rusas de vuelta a la altura del hombro.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Sit on a bench with your back straight and feet flat on the ground.

2. Initial Execution: Hold a kettlebell in each hand at shoulder height, palms facing forward.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Press the kettlebells overhead, fully extending your arms.

4. Controlled Return: Lower the kettlebells back to shoulder height.

