6. Paso 6: Inhala y baja lentamente la palanca de vuelta a la posición inicial.

7. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Adjust the machine to fit your body and sit on it with your back against the backrest.

2. Initial Execution: Place your lower legs under the padded lever, just above your ankles.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Grasp the handles on the sides of the machine for support.

4. Controlled Return: Keeping your upper legs stationary, exhale and curl your legs up as far as possible.

5. Step 5: Hold the contracted position for a brief pause as you squeeze your hamstrings.

6. Step 6: Inhale and slowly lower the lever back to the starting position.

7. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Ajuste a máquina a seu corpo e sente-se em ela com as costas apoiada no encosto.

2. Execução inicial: Coloque a parte desça das pernas abaixo da alavanca acolchoada, exatamente acima dos tornozelos.

