4. Retorno controlado: Haz una pausa por un momento y luego lleva lentamente las asas de vuelta hacia el pecho, manteniendo el control durante todo el movimiento.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Adjust the seat height and position yourself on the machine with your feet flat on the ground.

2. Initial Execution: Grasp the handles with an overhand grip and position your hands at chest level.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Push the handles forward until your arms are fully extended, keeping your elbows slightly bent.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment, then slowly bring the handles back towards your chest, maintaining control throughout the movement.

