4. Retorno controlado: Haz una pausa por un momento en la parte baja y luego empuja las asas de vuelta hacia arriba hasta la posición inicial extendiendo los brazos.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Adjust the seat height and position yourself on the machine with your back against the pad.

2. Initial Execution: Grasp the handles with an overhand grip and fully extend your arms in front of you.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Keeping your upper arms stationary, slowly lower the handles towards your forehead by bending your elbows.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the bottom, then push the handles back up to the starting position by extending your arms.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Ajuste a altura do assento e posicione-se na máquina com as costas apoiada na apoio acolchoado.

