3. Fase principal y control: Activa el core y baja el pecho hacia el balón flexionando los codos, manteniendo el cuerpo en línea recta.

4. Retorno controlado: Haz una pausa breve en la parte baja, luego empújate de nuevo hacia arriba a la posición inicial estirando los brazos.

5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Place the stability ball on the ground and position yourself facing down with your hands on the ball, shoulder-width apart.

2. Initial Execution: Extend your legs straight out behind you, balancing on your toes.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Engage your core and lower your chest towards the ball by bending your elbows, keeping your body in a straight line.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the bottom, then push yourself back up to the starting position by straightening your arms.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Coloque o bola suíça (fitball) no chão e fique de bruços com as mãos sobre o bola, afastadas na largura dos ombros.

