2. Initial Execution: Place the roller between your feet and grip it with your toes.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Engaging your abs, lift your legs off the ground and curl your knees towards your chest, rolling the roller towards your body.

4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your legs back down to the starting position, rolling the roller away from your body.

5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1. Posição inicial (Setup): Deite-se de barriga para cima com os braços estendidos retos acima da cabeça e as pernas retas frente a você.

