6. Paso 6: Dobla lentamente las rodillas y baja la placa de vuelta hacia tu cuerpo, controlando el movimiento.

7. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Adjust the seat of the sled machine so that your knees are at a 45-degree angle.

2. Initial Execution: Sit on the sled machine with your back against the backrest and your feet shoulder-width apart on the footplate.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Grip the handles on the sides of the seat for stability.

4. Controlled Return: Push the footplate away from your body by extending your legs, keeping your heels on the footplate.

5. Step 5: Pause for a moment at the fully extended position.

6. Step 6: Slowly bend your knees and lower the footplate back towards your body, controlling the movement.

