5. Paso 5: Mantén la posición alta por un momento, luego baja lentamente las caderas de nuevo a la posición inicial.

6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Position yourself on the smith machine with your back against the pad and your feet shoulder-width apart.

2. Initial Execution: Place your hands on the barbell, slightly wider than shoulder-width apart.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Engage your core and glutes, then push through your heels to raise your hips off the ground.

