6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.', '1. Starting Setup: Adjust the smith machine bar to a height that allows you to stand with your feet flat on the ground and your shoulders under the bar.

2. Initial Execution: Position yourself under the bar with your feet shoulder-width apart and your toes pointing forward.

3. Primary Phase & Control: Place your hands on the bar for stability.

